w 1\"},\n    {label: \"issue 2\", command: \"gh issue view 2\"},\n    {label: \"summarize\", command: \"echo done\"}\n  ],\n  queries: [\"root cause\", \"proposed fix\"],\n  concurrency: 2\n)",
